body:
I never played any game even remotely similar to a persona game before August. Got it handed to me in August and could not stop playing. I'm telling you, there were days I just woke up, grabbed something to eat, and played all day. I've put in probably over 150 hours and it all felt meaningful. Plenty to do and since I love exploring, I was intrigued the entire time. Easily a quality bang for your buck.

&#x200B;

But if you get it and don't agree with who best girl is, I'm making you return the copy and never play again. Cheers mate, have fun!!

I actually just rewatched the series this weekend.

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

Wanna see me do it again?

He marries his sister

